    {
      "id": "p0143-b005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "This is a humorous reference to the stereotypical signs found at American tourist destinations, such as \"Welcome to historic Licking, Missouri\" and \"Welcome to scenic Boogertown, North Carolina\". Naturally, referring to the inside of one's home as a scenic tourist destination sounds ridiculous. The entire English sentence sounds off-kilter at first, too.",
        "raw": "This is a humorous reference to the stereotypical signs found at American\ntourist destinations, such as \"Welcome to historic Licking, Missouri\" and\n\"Welcome to scenic Boogertown, North Carolina\". Naturally, referring to the\ninside of one's home as a scenic tourist destination sounds ridiculous. The\nentire English sentence sounds off-kilter at first, too.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.08340959,
          0.32893571,
          0.67393111,
          0.41475
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.08136524,
          0.32822143,
          0.69711407,
          0.41582143
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          14,
          15,
          16,
          17,
          18
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "这句玩笑模仿了美国旅游景点常见的欢迎标语，例如“欢迎来到历史悠久的密苏里州利金市”和“欢迎来到风景秀丽的北卡罗来纳州 Boogertown”。把自己家里说成景色优美的旅游胜地，自然很荒唐。而且整句英语一开始听起来也有点别扭。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
      "annotations": [],
      "layout": {
        "bbox": [
          0.08846937,
          0.32750714,
          0.69506972,
          0.41832143
        ],
        "font_size": 20,
        "line_height": 1.45,
        "font_weight": 450,
        "background": "transparent",
        "text_align": "justify",
        "auto_height": true,
        "limit_bottom": 0.5078571428571429,
        "snap_to_guides": true,
        "resize_anchor": "left",
        "gap_before": 12,
        "flow_after": "p0143-b004"
      },
      "calibration": {
        "bbox": [
          0.08846937,
          0.32750714,
          0.69506972,
          0.41832143
        ],
        "font_size": 20,
